NNAAMMEE
     ppcciidduummpp — show PCI device data

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     ppcciidduummpp [--vv] [--xx | --xxxx | --xxxxxx] [--dd _p_c_i_d_e_v] [_b_u_s:_d_e_v:_f_u_n_c]
